HDR entries in Advanced Video Options, where the game hides its own: a list of None, Soft, ACES
and AgX that sets r_HDRRendering and d3d12_ToneMap, the tone map of the HDR pipeline of
XRenderD3D12, and next to the Basic Video Options button a list of SDR, HDR10 and scRGB that sets
d3d12_HDROutput, its output to a display in HDR mode (both greyed out with another renderer).
Patch Scripts.cmd applies it to FCData/Scripts.pak.

